00:43:44,955 --> 00:43:49,585
<i>♪ Panatilihin itong kumikilos, galaw</i>
<i>Ilagay ako sa posisyon, panatilihin itong gumagalaw ♪</i>

837
00:43:49,668 --> 00:43:50,961
Nakakabaliw yun.

838
00:43:51,962 --> 00:43:54,340
[Josh] Ibig kong sabihin,
ang bigat ng kanyang katawan ay nagpapadali.

839
00:43:54,423 --> 00:43:56,216
Hindi siya aabot.

840
00:43:58,052 --> 00:43:59,470
Paano kung matupad niya ito?

841
00:43:59,553 --> 00:44:02,264
<i>♪ Kaya mo ba?</i>
<i>Magtiwala ♪</i>

842
00:44:04,975 --> 00:44:05,976
<i>♪ Magtiwala ♪</i>

843
00:44:06,060 --> 00:44:08,812
<i>♪ Kaya kita</i>
<i>Kaya mo ba? ♪</i>

844
00:44:08,896 --> 00:44:10,022
<i>♪ Magtiwala ♪</i>

845
00:44:12,733 --> 00:44:13,901
<i>-♪ Tiwala ♪</i>
-[Ungol si Teagan]

846
00:44:13,984 --> 00:44:15,819
<i>♪ Kaya kita</i>
<i>Kaya mo ba? ♪</i>

847
00:44:15,903 --> 00:44:16,737
<i>♪ Magtiwala ♪</i>

848
00:44:16,820 --> 00:44:18,822
<i>♪ Ooh, la-la</i>
<i>Papasukin mo ako na parang ga-ga-ga ♪</i>

849
00:44:18,906 --> 00:44:20,032
[nagpapahirap]

850
00:44:20,115 --> 00:44:24,078
<i>♪ Ooh, la-la</i>
<i>Kaya kita, kaya mo ba? ♪</i>

851
00:44:24,161 --> 00:44:27,164
<i>♪ Magtiwala, ooh, la-la</i>
<i>Papasukin mo ako na parang ga-ga-ga ♪</i>

852
00:44:27,247 --> 00:44:29,249
<i>♪ Tiwala</i>
<i>Ooh, la-la ♪</i>

853
00:44:29,333 --> 00:44:31,335
<i>♪ Kaya kita, kaya mo ba? ♪</i>

854
00:44:31,418 --> 00:44:35,547
[nagpapahirap]

855
00:44:35,631 --> 00:44:39,426
<i>♪ Shoot me to the stars, wala na ako</i>
<i>Oh, ang daing mo ang paborito kong kanta ♪</i>

856
00:44:39,510 --> 00:44:41,512
[ungol]

857
00:44:41,595 --> 00:44:44,306
-[mabagal na huminto ang musika]
-[hinihingal]

858
00:44:44,390 --> 00:44:51,146
[mabilis ang tibok ng puso]

859
00:44:54,942 --> 00:44:59,196
[patuloy ang musika, hindi napigilan]

860
00:45:00,280 --> 00:45:03,409
<i>♪ Kaya kita, kaya mo ba? ♪</i>

861
00:45:03,492 --> 00:45:05,494
May nagtatapos ba talaga?

862
00:45:08,914 --> 00:45:10,749
Anak mo ba yan?

863
00:45:10,833 --> 00:45:12,084
[Ella] Oh my gosh, nagawa niya.

864
00:45:12,167 --> 00:45:14,002
-[Hayden] Banal na impiyerno.
-[Ella] Go, Teagan!

865
00:45:16,296 --> 00:45:17,297
[tunog]

866
00:45:17,381 --> 00:45:19,591
[humalakhak at pumalakpak ang mga tao]

867
00:45:20,384 --> 00:45:21,593
[Ella] Go, Teagan!

868
00:45:22,094 --> 00:45:23,637
[patuloy ang cheering]

869
00:45:26,932 --> 00:45:28,475
[lalaki] Magaling, Josh!

870
00:45:28,559 --> 00:45:29,560
[babae] Sweet, Josh!

871
00:45:29,643 --> 00:45:31,145
[boy] Fuck, yeah!

872
00:45:31,228 --> 00:45:32,271
Nagawa mo!

873
00:45:32,354 --> 00:45:33,814
[boy 2] Sabi ko sayo, sabi ko sayo!

874
00:45:33,897 --> 00:45:37,526
natapos mo.
Hindi nagawa sa loob ng anim na taon. Magandang trabaho.

875
00:45:41,655 --> 00:45:43,532
Sayang at hinayaan mo munang matapos ang pinsan mo.

876
00:45:45,659 --> 00:45:46,660
Uh-huh.

877
00:45:50,497 --> 00:45:51,749
[boy] Apat lang?

878
00:45:56,044 --> 00:45:58,922
[Hayden] Kami lang ang team
na may nakatapos.

879
00:45:59,006 --> 00:46:02,426
Hindi lang isa, kundi apat. I'm damn proud.

880
00:46:03,719 --> 00:46:06,597
Ryder, Cam, Josh.

881
00:46:07,347 --> 00:46:10,434
At ginawa mo ito sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod kay Teagan.

882
00:46:11,643 --> 00:46:14,229
Kaya subukan mong tandaan iyon
sa susunod naming practice.

883
00:46:14,855 --> 00:46:17,191
Ryder. Na-stroke ka.

884
00:46:18,650 --> 00:46:19,943
Sige, mag shower na tayo.

885
00:46:20,027 --> 00:46:23,155
Ilalabas na kita
para sa mga burger at aso. Tara na!

886
00:46:28,702 --> 00:46:31,747
Pinatunayan mo ang iyong sarili ngayon.
Nalaman mo kung ano ang nag-uudyok sa kanila.

887
00:46:32,623 --> 00:46:34,792
Mga isyu at lungkot ni Daddy? [tumawa]

888
00:46:34,875 --> 00:46:36,126
At grit.

889
00:46:36,210 --> 00:46:37,044
[nagtawanan ang dalawa]

890
00:46:38,837 --> 00:46:41,173
Yeah, I guess nakuha ko yun sa tatay ko.

891
00:46:42,090 --> 00:46:43,217
Pupunta ka sa hapunan?

892
00:46:43,884 --> 00:46:47,763
-Salamat, ngunit makakasama ko ang aking ina.
-Magkita tayo sa practice.

893
00:46:49,681 --> 00:46:52,976
El, masaya akong naabutan ka.

894
00:46:59,483 --> 00:47:01,485
So magkakilala kayong dalawa?

895
00:47:02,361 --> 00:47:03,362
Oo.

896
00:47:03,445 --> 00:47:05,572
Siya ang rower na kilala mo noon.

897
00:47:05,656 --> 00:47:06,949
Oo, siya noon.

898
00:47:07,032 --> 00:47:11,328
-Ah. Higit pa ba kayo sa mga kaibigan?
-Hindi, hindi naging kami.

899
00:47:11,411 --> 00:47:12,371
[Teagan] Mm-hmm.

900
00:47:13,455 --> 00:47:18,126
Oh, kailangan mong sabihin sa akin
kung paano mo natapos ang karera na iyon. Nakakabaliw yun.

901
00:47:18,919 --> 00:47:20,045
Uh…

902
00:47:22,047 --> 00:47:24,716
Isang bagay na itinuro sa akin ni Papa.

903
00:47:26,301 --> 00:47:31,265
Kakaiba naman. Lahat mali
sa buhay natin ngayon ay... kasalanan niya.

904
00:47:31,348 --> 00:47:33,100
Pero…

905
00:47:35,936 --> 00:47:37,813
Oo, siya ang nagpalusot sa akin.

906
00:47:39,231 --> 00:47:41,108
[pagpapatugtog ng emosyonal na musika]

907
00:47:52,870 --> 00:47:57,583
Naantala ang pagsisimula ng pananakit ng kalamnan
ay isang malupit na ginang.

908
00:47:57,666 --> 00:47:59,918
Ano ang lahat ng ito?

909
00:48:00,460 --> 00:48:04,423
Ito ay isang mood board para sa isang birthday party.

910
00:48:04,506 --> 00:48:07,885
Mayroon akong unang kliyente
bilang tagaplano ng kaganapan.

911
00:48:07,968 --> 00:48:10,053
Nakapagplano ka na ba ng isang kaganapan dati?

912
00:48:10,137 --> 00:48:12,014
Marami na akong nagawang behind-the-scenes.

913
00:48:12,097 --> 00:48:15,475
Kakayanin ko yata ang isang birthday party
para sa isang teenager na atleta.

914
00:48:15,976 --> 00:48:19,563
At saka, ito ay magtatakpan
iyong tuition para sa term.

915
00:48:19,646 --> 00:48:21,440
[tumunog ang doorbell]

916
00:48:21,523 --> 00:48:24,276
Mga kliyente ko yan.
Please kunwari nirerespeto mo ako.

917
00:48:24,359 --> 00:48:25,611
Sinabi mo bang atleta?

918
00:48:26,153 --> 00:48:27,821
Anong sport?

919
00:48:27,905 --> 00:48:29,865
-Nay, ayos lang.
-Naglagay lang ako ng cover-up diyan.

920
00:48:31,033 --> 00:48:32,034
Hindi.

921
00:48:32,910 --> 00:48:33,994
Teagan.

922
00:48:35,162 --> 00:48:36,413
Hindi mo ba kami papapasukin?

923
00:48:43,420 --> 00:48:47,132
[Nakakaintriga na tumutugtog ng musika]

924
00:49:40,519 --> 00:49:42,521
[natapos ang musika]
